        "chapter": 47,
        "verse": 1
      },
      {
        "text": "Take the millstones, and grind meal: uncover thy locks, make bare the leg, uncover the thigh, pass over the rivers.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4,
            "text": "IE Prepare to become slaves."
          },
          {
            "start": 94,
            "end": 114,
            "text": "IE on the way to exile."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 2,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Isaiah 47:2",
        "book": "Isaiah",
        "chapter": 47,
        "verse": 2
      },
      {
        "text": "Thy nakedness shall be uncovered, yea, thy shame shall be seen: I will take vengeance, and I will not meet thee as a man.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 91,
            "end": 92,
            "text": "IE I will not negotiate or compromise in this matter."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
